# Pairs with OwnerMonotonic. The source enters Reject before the retroactive
# sweep has run, so the sweep never runs and a prepare that predates the window
# never reaches the destination the map then moves k2 to.
MODULE: OwnerMonotonicFreezeBeforeSweep
TARGET: OwnerMonotonic
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the split freezes before its retroactive sweep, so a visible commit reverts when the map moves
PERTURBS: SplitFreeze

--- FIND
SplitFreeze ==
    /\ sp = "swept"
--- REPLACE
SplitFreeze ==
\* MUTATION: the freeze does not wait for the sweep.
    /\ sp \in SplitWindow
--- END